<ns0:section xmlns:ns0="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id991e8d88-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc" identifier="/us/usc/t42/s2000h–5"><ns0:num value="2000h–5">§ 2000h–5.</ns0:num><ns0:heading> Authorization of appropriations</ns0:heading><ns0:content>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">There are hereby authorized to be appropriated such sums as are necessary to carry out the provisions of this Act.</ns0:p>
</ns0:content><ns0:sourceCredit id="id991e8d89-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc">(<ns0:ref href="/us/pl/88/352/tXI/s1105">Pub. L. 88–352, title XI, § 1105</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1964-07-02">July 2, 1964</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/78/268">78 Stat. 268</ns0:ref>.)</ns0:sourceCredit>
<ns0:notes type="uscNote" id="id991e8d8a-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc">
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="editorialNotes" id="id991e8d8b-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc"><ns0:heading class="centered"><ns0:b>Editorial Notes</ns0:b></ns0:heading></ns0:note>
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I75" topic="referencesInText" id="id991e8d8c-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc">
<ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">References in Text</ns0:heading><ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">This Act, referred to in text, is <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/88/352">Pub. L. 88–352</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1964-07-02">July 2, 1964</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/78/241">78 Stat. 241</ns0:ref>, known as the Civil Rights Act of 1964, which is classified principally to subchapters II to IX of this chapter (§ 2000a et seq.). For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see Short Title note set out under <ns0:ref href="/us/usc/t42/s2000a">section 2000a of this title</ns0:ref> and Tables.</ns0:p>
</ns0:note>
</ns0:notes>
</ns0:section>
